# Keep local build output and caches out of `vercel deploy` uploads (Turbopack's dev cache alone is several hundred MB and Vercel rejects files over 100 MB).
.next
.next-*
.vercel
node_modules
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.env*.local
.cache
scripts/placeholders/unsplash
# The owner's original pictures (scripts/figma/source, 21 MB) are the inputs of the picture builder, not of the site: the site serves the cut files in public/img.
scripts/figma/source
